          "to": "Modern Hebrew [t]",
          "note": "Standard Modern Hebrew has lost the distinction between the stop and fricative variants of the letter Tāw, realizing both as [t] (partly due to the influence of Yiddish and other languages without dental fricatives)."
        }
      ]
    },
